1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,984
Ever stood at a bus stop with no idea what's coming, or when?

2
00:00:03,984 --> 00:00:10,065
Meet CrowdTransit — the free app that finds every bus, train, and ferry stop near you.

3
00:00:10,065 --> 00:00:17,994
See exactly who runs each stop, with real upcoming departures, tagged live when real-time data is available.

4
00:00:17,994 --> 00:00:23,697
Tap any route, and see every single stop it makes, from one end of the line to the other.

5
00:00:23,697 --> 00:00:29,752
Rate stops, report live conditions, and help your community know what's really happening, right now.

6
00:00:29,752 --> 00:00:30,703
It's free.

7
00:00:30,703 --> 00:00:31,770
No ads.

8
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:32,838
No catch.

9
00:00:32,838 --> 00:00:35,494
Just find your ride, and share the knowledge.

10
00:00:35,494 --> 00:00:36,640
CrowdTransit.

11
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:37,838
Available now.

